<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces have relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy while the defence minister reported killing nearly 285 al-Shabaab fighters, including 12 leaders, in Bay, Shabelle and Hiiraan. The United States conducted airstrikes on three al-Shabaab sites in Somalia. President Museveni of Uganda met Somalia's president to discuss regional security and the AU peacekeeping transition, and the Ugandan army chief visited Somali troops amid a withdrawal from Barawe. Somalia warned that unrest in Ethiopia could weaken security operations involving the African Union mission. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/yemen/yemen-emergency-unhcr-external-update-8-23-november-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOY0dyaTRNZXgtS2lrc0l0c001WEpYdXp5OUowWEx3QU9ZRXViZVh1UGZQaERtOTRuZGZ0TzJZeTZoUmtxOE00TERiR0VQUlRQamFJYVZ1dU5UWFlSNzZfMGVTTlQxWXRFMXk2MXplZVFTUmhqS0lzVlRhRkVDQ2t2cXZzak5SYmhfNW91YXVTd0ZKaGlNRS05NlNsU2gxWmNENEg4R2psaGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNcXRHODRQWWtDam5OVFpLcnFtdEd3dzFWT191NWVjc0tidEg2b0wtdng2SXRTVGZ6LW5QcU10WGJwcGZlREFNa1ZQd2VsQ2FMbFJLZXY3dkloMUc2czlLa3BpZm9aVnhDQU5pd0h1V2xkenpmdXdWXzdLLTNhQmFZVXEyN1JkYmkwYzA1SUNObF9UNnotTTA5WDByYUFnczVHa2VvNVVTVnRiRUZtRTA0dmJLaW41TTVMZGJrQnp2NGdPUXF2RGYyQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE80LV94STM1SUl4STJUdTFIakJwZkItTGtuR2ExaUJUM3BZUjA5YkhuR21oRFVaM2REVndTMGhIWDVObE5VWnNyVWVITTBtalFDQ3lzXzY0YWxaUDJSVEtnWDlDejBkUHJieDBn?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&